{
 "id": 1326344,
 "titulo": "v470 Update Details #1",
 "fecha": 1546938085498,
 "modificada": 1732978057732,
 "url": "https://forum.netmarble.com/futurefight_en/view/2196/1326344",
 "html": "<p><img style=\"font-size: 11px;\" src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/01/081112/eeeuPdate.jpg\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">Greetings, Agents!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">CM Debris here with news regarding the latest update!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">It&rsquo;s been a long wait, but it&rsquo;s finally here. Get ready for the first changes of 2019, coming soon!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #333333;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">It seems like a lot of Agents are excited for January&rsquo;s update because of our Sneak Peeks! After a very long wait, here are the first part of the Update Details.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">Challenges have been revamped and a brand new Achievement System has been added! Prepare yourself for the <strong>Challenge System Improvements!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">Now there are more ways to appreciate some of your Characters! <strong>A new set of categories for the Uniform Collection and Comics has been added!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #333333;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">And for your convenience and smoother gameplay,<strong> various issues and improvements have been fixed </strong>in this update.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #333333;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/01/081112/5345.png\" /></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">The January update doesn&rsquo;t end there!</span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">The mystery behind the question mark (?) like symbol on our Pre-Update </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">Event token and more details regarding our January update will be released on a different notice <strong>before the maintenance ends!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #333333;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">For more information regarding the newest set of characters joining MARVEL Future Fight, check out our next update notice!</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Cambria Math','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Cambria Math'; color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: Gulim; color: #ff6c00;\"> Improvements on Challenges</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: Gulim; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Prepare for a major change to our Challenges feature!</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: Gulim; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Your existing Character, Quest, and Forum challenges have now been merged into &ldquo;Achievement&rdquo;.</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: Gulim; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">New tasks have been added and you can enhance your Achievement Score by unlocking more Achievements!</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: Gulim; color: #ff6c00;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">1. An all-new Achievement Tab has been added.</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/01/081112/23232a1.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Malgun Gothic'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Gulim; color: #5b9bd5; mso-themecolor: accent1;\">- In the Achievement Summary screen, you can now see your current&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Achievement Score, Level, and progress.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">[Achievement Chest Contents]</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/01/081224/4535345345.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">2. Character Achievement System screen has been improved.</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/01/081112/23232c1.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/01/081112/23232c2.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #5b9bd5; font-size: 12pt;\">- You can now see a list of Achievements per character.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">3. Quest and Forum Achievement Quests have now been added.</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/01/081112/23232d1.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #5b9bd5; font-size: 12pt;\">- Subcategories to Quests and Forum achievements have been added for easier viewing.&nbsp; </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #5b9bd5; font-size: 12pt;\">- Achievements you can achieve by playing various content, such as Giant Boss Raid and Epic Quests, have been added.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Malgun Gothic'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Gulim;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">4. You can now view your Achievement Score and Level on the P&#108;ayer Information screen.</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/01/081112/23232e1.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: Gulim; color: #5b9bd5; mso-themecolor: accent1; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">- You can check your Achievement Score on the P&#108;ayer Information screen as well!&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">[Removed Achievements after the January Update]</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span></strong><img style=\"font-size: 11px;\" src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/01/081112/23232f1.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: red; font-size: 12pt;\">* Only the Agents who have cleared the removed achievements before the January update, but have not received the rewards, will receive the rewards into their Inbox after the update.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Cambria Math','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Cambria Math'; color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong></span><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: Gulim; color: #ff6c00;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"> Character Ranking System Improvements&nbsp;</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoCommentText\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 107%; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: normal;\">A new Character Ranking category: Popular Character has been added. </span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoCommentText\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 107%; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: normal;\">You can now identify which character is currently popular!</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">World Boss Ranking</span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: normal;\"> has been improved to reflect more accurate rankings.</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Malgun Gothic'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Gulim; color: red; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">* Story and Timeline Battle Character Ranking has been removed for the meantime and will be improved in the future.&nbsp;</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoCommentText\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">1. </span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Malgun Gothic'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin;\">Popular Character category has been added.&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoCommentText\">&nbsp;<img style=\"font-size: 11px;\" src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/01/081112/23232g1.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #5b9bd5; mso-themecolor: accent1;\">- Other Agents can now check out which Character you&rsquo;ve grown the most.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Malgun Gothic'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">2. World Boss Ranking has been improved.&nbsp;</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Malgun Gothic'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;<img style=\"font-size: 11px;\" src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/01/081112/23232g2.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Malgun Gothic'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; color: #5b9bd5; mso-themecolor: accent1;\">- You can now see which characters are most commonly used to clear a </span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Malgun Gothic'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; color: #5b9bd5; mso-themecolor: accent1;\">&nbsp; specific World Boss!</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #5b9bd5; font-size: 12pt;\">- You can also check the rankings for both Normal and Ultimate difficulty.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong></span><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Malgun Gothic'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Gulim; color: #ff6c00;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana;\"> World Boss Improvements</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Malgun Gothic'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Gulim; font-weight: normal;\">1.</span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Malgun Gothic'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Gulim;\"> The Recommended Character feature has been added.</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Recommended Characters are now visible on the &#83;elect Character screen. </span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">The Recommended Characters are affected by the current World Boss ranking, </span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">and a suitable Team Effect for the battle.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/01/081156/23232g3.png\" /></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoCommentText\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #5b9bd5;\">- While &#115;electing your characters for World Boss mode, the recommended characters will be displayed on top.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoCommentText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Malgun Gothic'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Gulim;\">2. The ability to &#115;elect your recently used characters in a World Boss stage has been added.</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">The filter function has been improved with the addition of a &ldquo;Recent&rdquo; category. With this, you can now choose your preferred characters more easily!</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;<img style=\"font-size: 11px;\" src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/01/081210/23232h4.png\" /></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoCommentText\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Malgun Gothic'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; color: #5b9bd5; mso-themecolor: accent1;\">- Each of the bosses in World Boss mode have their own &ldquo;recent&rdquo; character filter.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoCommentText\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoCommentText\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Malgun Gothic'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; color: #5b9bd5; mso-themecolor: accent1;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: black;\">3. Upon &#115;electing your preferred character, the &ldquo;Recent&rdquo; filter feature has been added to save your chosen Ally Characters for each World Boss.</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoCommentText\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/01/081156/23232h3.png\" /></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoCommentText\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Cambria Math','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Cambria Math'; color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong></span><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: Gulim; color: #ff6c00;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"> 3 New Uniform Collection Themes have been added.&nbsp;</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: Gulim; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">New themes in the Uniform Collection feature have been added! </span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: Gulim; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Gaze upon your Characters&rsquo; awesome appearance and get rewarded as a bonus!</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoCommentText\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 107%; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">Monsters Unleashed!</span></strong></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\"> Which depicts an endless battle with monsters, has been added!<br /> Also, an expanded version of <strong>Marvel&rsquo;s <em>Avengers: Infinity War</em></strong> has been added! Watch our heroes&rsquo; team up to fight Thanos!</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoCommentText\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: Gulim;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">[Monsters Unleashed!]</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/01/081156/23232i1.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">[Avengers Infinity War #1]</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/01/081156/23232i2.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">[Avengers Infinity War #2]</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/01/081156/23232i3.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #5b9bd5; font-size: 12pt;\">- Register your Uniforms with their respective themes and enjoy the collection in its perfect form!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #ff6c00;\"> 5 New Comic Cards have been added. </span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\">New Comic Cards have been added in-game! </span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\">The theme of the cards are: Monsters Unleashed!</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\">The cards feature Elsa Bloodstone, Hulk (Amadeus Cho), Medusa, Kid Kaiju, and Moon Girl from the comics!</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">Enhance your characters using these new cards!</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/01/081156/23232j1.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #5b9bd5; font-size: 12pt;\">- You can upgrade all of them up to Mythic rank, giving you an All Attack +5% buff!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Cambria Math','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Cambria Math'; color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong> <strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'MS Mincho'; mso-bidi-font-family: Gulim; color: #ff6c00; mso-fareast-language: JA;\">Added Type Enhancement Chests!</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'MS Mincho'; mso-bidi-font-family: Gulim; color: #ff6c00; mso-fareast-language: JA;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">This is a special chest where you can acquire Type Enhancement kits that can maximize the efficiency of your characters. </span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">You can get a rank 1-6 enhancement kit for each type affinity with a fixed probability.</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/01/081621/23232l143.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #4472c4; mso-themecolor: accent5;\">- </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'MS Mincho'; mso-bidi-font-family: Gulim; color: #4472c4; mso-themecolor: accent5; mso-fareast-language: JA;\">Keep a close eye on the store, because the type rate up which gives more Type Enhancement kits of a specific type, will change on a regular basis.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Cambria Math','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Cambria Math'; color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: Gulim; color: #ff6c00;\"> Other Improvements</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">1. Every time you claim an item from the Inbox, you can now see a detailed information of the items you receive.&nbsp;</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/01/081224/23232l1.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">2.&nbsp;In Timeline Battle,&nbsp;the list of recommended and banned characters has been adjusted.&nbsp;</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Cambria Math','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Cambria Math'; color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: Gulim; color: #ff6c00;\"> Other Fixes</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Malgun Gothic'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; color: #333333;\">1</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Malgun Gothic'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; color: #333333; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Malgun Gothic'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; color: #333333;\"> Fixed an issue where advancing Luna Snow to Tier-3 would play the Tier-3 Advancement BGM and game-based BGM at the same time. </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Malgun Gothic'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; color: #333333;\">2.</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Malgun Gothic'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; color: #333333;\"> Luna Snow&rsquo;s Character Usage Tip has been updated to reflect her new Tier-3 Skill.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Malgun Gothic'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; color: #333333;\">3. </span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Malgun Gothic'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; color: #333333;\">Fixed an issue with Heroic Quest mode where the Stop Quest Pack prompt appears twice in certain situations.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Malgun Gothic'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; color: #333333;\">4.</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Malgun Gothic'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; color: #333333;\"> Fixed the visual bug related to the S.H.I.E.L.D. Special Support package where after you purchase the pack, the amount of Biometrics that appears on certain missions is displaying as 10/20 instead of 20/20.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Malgun Gothic'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; color: #333333;\">5. </span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Malgun Gothic'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; color: #333333;\">Fixed the issue wherein no X-Gene is being acquired from the 10th clear after getting 2 X-Genes from the 9th clear (also, the X-Gene Count is stuck at 1/10) upon playing X-Force/X-Men Epic Quests on the highest difficulty.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Malgun Gothic'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; color: #333333;\">6. </span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Malgun Gothic'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; color: #333333;\">Fixed the issue where our System Messages are displaying incorrect information when opening a Chest where you can acquire characters.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">We are currently preparing for the next main announcement which includes the characters of our January update!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Malgun Gothic'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; color: #333333;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Stay tuned!</span></span></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"http://sgimage.netmarble.com/images/puble/community/GAME/futurefight_en/2196/2018/11/27/1543305634499.jpg\" /></p>"
}